(Japanese: '''燃えよ！ドラゴンタイプ！''' ''Get Fired Up! Dragon Type!'') is a {{pkmn|4Koma}} {{pkmn|manga}} created by 山下たかひろ [[Takahiro Yamashita]]. It is available online on the Japanese [http://www.pokemon.jp/special/dragontype/manga/ Dragon Pokémon] official web page. {{p|Horsea}}, {{p|Dratini}}, {{p|Bagon}}, {{p|Gible}}, {{p|Axew}}, {{p|Deino}}, {{p|Goomy}}, and {{p|Rayquaza}} are each featured in their own four-panel comic strip.

